  "body": "Editorial.\n\nFixing links to the [CSS2 draft specification](https://drafts.csswg.org/css2/) (sub-pages apparently not being generated anymore resulting in 404s, for example: [line box](https://drafts.csswg.org/css2/visuren.html#line-box) ). Verified each of these changes to ensure they link to the correct spot in the single-page draft.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/5705/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 1, 2020, 9:09 PM UTC (a15ece6)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5705/8518025...a15ece6/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 1, 2020, 9:09 PM UTC (a15ece6)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/5705/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 1, 2020, 9:09 PM UTC (a15ece6)\">/canvas.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5705/8518025...a15ece6/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 1, 2020, 9:09 PM UTC (a15ece6)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/5705/dnd.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 1, 2020, 9:09 PM UTC (a15ece6)\">/dnd.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5705/8518025...a15ece6/dnd.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 1, 2020, 9:09 PM UTC (a15ece6)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html/5705/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 1, 2020, 9:09 PM UTC (a15ece6)\">/dom.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5705/8518025...a15ece6/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 1, 2020, 9:09 PM UTC (a15ece6)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/whatwg-html